      "message": "1. trace_android_rvh_set_cpus_allowed_comm()\n   in this hook, we get all task\u0027s cpus_mask, and backup the cpus_mask to oem\u0027s data, because set_cpus_allowed_common() is a low level common interface for all kinds of  cpuset operation, it could meet the our requirement of Real-time Synchronization between cpus_mask and its backup.\n\n2. trace_android_vh_sched_setaffinity()\n   the hook is called by user space, is to block the blacklist application\u0027s  cpu affinity, and record its status in which the block app can un-block later.\n\nso the two hooks are also necessary for our feature.",
