      "message": "Thanks for the explanation.\n\n\u003e 2. trace_android_vh_sched_setaffinity()\n\u003e    the hook is called by user space, is to block the blacklist application\u0027s  cpu affinity, and record its status in which the block app can un-block later.\n\nWe have multiple partners using the existing hook in sched_setaffinity to do exactly this, any particular reason why it can\u0027t be used for your use-case?",
